## Pending: shell echo
The injected key reaches the cell's HID decode ([xhci] key down/up code=0x10). Delivery to the shell needs the input service to accept this cell as a raw producer; that gate today accepts only the singleton service::NIC_DRIVER tid, which this cell must not claim. Key delivery is therefore pending the owner's kernel-verified USB-input-producer role.
